# Round 79: vec_loop's own BOUND, three holes at one site. (a) A
# bound reading a buffer the loop WRITES went stale in the hoisted
# _n -- the VM re-evaluates the condition every iteration (VM exits
# after one iteration when b[0] shrinks; the hoist ran three) -- now
# the round-78 index-shape-blind rule covers the bound and demotes
# to scalar.
b is buffer of 10
b[0] is 3
b[1] is 9
i is 0
loop while i < b[0]:
    b[i] is 1
    i is i + 1
print of i
print of b[1]
print of b[2]
